Write opentide MCP configuration for editors and agents.

␛[1m␛[4mUsage:␛[0m ␛[1mopentide setup mcp␛[0m [OPTIONS]

␛[1m␛[4mOptions:␛[0m
  ␛[1m-C␛[0m, ␛[1m--path␛[0m <PATH_FLAG>
          Repository path
          
          [default: .]

      ␛[1m--vscode␛[0m
          Configure VS Code (.vscode/mcp.json)

      ␛[1m--cursor␛[0m
          Configure Cursor (.cursor/mcp.json)

      ␛[1m--claude-code␛[0m
          Configure Claude Code (.mcp.json)

      ␛[1m--generic␛[0m
          Configure any MCP host (opentide.mcp.json)

      ␛[1m--plan␛[0m
